rt":546},{"depth":2,"role":"P","text":"","tree_line_end":551,"tree_line_start":548},{"depth":2,"role":"P","text":"\n\n\n\n","tree_line_end":565,"tree_line_start":552},{"depth":2,"role":"P","text":"\n\n","tree_line_end":575,"tree_line_start":566},{"depth":2,"role":"P","text":"","tree_line_end":577,"tree_line_start":576},{"depth":2,"role":"P","text":"","tree_line_end":582,"tree_line_start":578},{"depth":2,"role":"P","text":"\n\n","tree_line_end":588,"tree_line_start":583},{"depth":2,"role":"L","text":"\n\n\n\n\n\n\n","tree_line_end":608,"tree_line_start":589},{"depth":3,"role":"LI","text":"\n\n\n","tree_line_end":599,"tree_line_start":591},{"depth":3,"role":"LI","text":"\n\n\n","tree_line_end":608,"tree_line_start":600},{"depth":2,"role":"P","text":"","tree_line_end":610,"tree_line_start":609},{"depth":2,"role":"P","text":"\n\n","tree_line_end":616,"tree_line_start":611},{"depth":2,"role":"L","text":"\n\n\n","tree_line_end":628,"tree_line_start":617},{"depth":3,"role":"LI","text":"\n","tree_line_end":623,"tree_line_start":619},{"depth":3,"role":"LI","text":"\n","tree_line_end":628,"tree_line_start":624},{"depth":2,"role":"P","text":"","tree_line_end":631,"tree_line_start":629},{"depth":2,"role":"P","text":" Example ","tree_line_end":633,"tree_line_start":632},{"depth":2,"role":"P","text":"The claimant is a single woman who was 60 on 8.5.05 and who deferred her RP for twelve months. She has capital of £8,000. On 8.5.06 she claims RP and SPC but does not immediately make an election on her deferral option. SPC is awarded to the claimant, taking into account her RP and £4.00 deemed weekly income due to her capital. On 5.6.06 the claimant elects to receive increments. The decision awarding RP is revised to include increments. The decision awarding SPC is also revised to take into account the claimant’s increased RP. On 26.6.06 the claimant realises she would have been better off taking a lump sum so she changes her election. As she is liable for tax, the claimant receives a lump sum of £7,200 rather than the amount of £8,000 she would have received if she were not liable for tax. Of the claimant’s total capital of £15,200, the amount of £8,000 (the gross amount of the lump sum) is disregarded. The decision awarding SPC is superseded to reduce the amount of deemed weekly income to be taken into account to £3.00. ","tree_line_end":635,"tree_line_start":634},{"depth":2,"role":"P","text":"","tree_line_end":640,"tree_line_start":636},{"depth":2,"role":"P","text":"\n\n","tree_line_end":650,"tree_line_start":641},{"depth":2,"role":"P","text":"","tree_line_end":652,"tree_line_start":651},{"depth":2,"role":"L","text":"\n\n\n\n","tree_line_end":667,"tree_line_start":653},{"depth":3,"role":"LI","text":"\n","tree_line_end":659,"tree_line_start":655},{"depth":3,"role":"LI","text":"\n\n","tree_line_end":667,"tree_line_start":660},{"depth":2,"role":"P","text":"","tree_line_end":670,"tree_line_start":668},{"depth":2,"role":"P","text":"\n","tree_line_end":676,"tree_line_start":671},{"depth":2,"role":"P","text":"\n","tree_line_end":681,"tree_line_start":677},{"depth":2,"role":"P","text":"\n\n","tree_line_end":687,"tree_line_start":682},{"depth":2,"role":"P","text":"\n\n","tree_line_end":693,"tree_line_start":688},{"depth":2,"role":"P","text":"\n\n","tree_line_end":702,"tree_line_start":694},{"depth":2,"role":"P","text":"\n\n\n","tree_line_end":713,"tree_line_start":703},{"depth":2,"role":"P","text":"","tree_line_end":717,"tree_line_start":714},{"depth":2,"role":"P","text":"","tree_line_end":719,"tree_line_start":718},{"depth":2,"role":"P","text":"","tree_line_end":721,"tree_line_start":720},{"depth":2,"role":"L","text":"\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n","tree_line_end":744,"tree_line_start":722},{"depth":3,"role":"LI","text":"\n\n\n","tree_line_end":732,"tree_line_start":724},{"depth":3,"role":"LI","text":"\n\n\n","tree_line_end":741,"tree_line_start":733},{"depth":3,"role":"P","text":"","tree_line_end":744,"tree_line_start":742},{"depth":2,"role":"P","text":"","tre